                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P>  <FONT size=3 face=宋体>由于市直“三名奖励”方案的实施，现对学校的《<SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><FONT size=3>绍兴市第一中学教科研成果奖励细则》</FONT></SPAN>进行修订和完善，特此告知。</FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">绍兴市第一中学教科研成果奖励细则<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">(</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">试行稿<SPAN lang=EN-US>)<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">为进一步推进学校课程建设和学科教学改革，根据《绍兴市第一中学三年发展规划》、《市直学校争创“名师名科名校”激励办法》的文件精神，特修订完善《绍兴市第一中学教科研成果奖励细则》。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%">一、市直“三名”奖励</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">根据《市直学校争创“名师名科名校”激励办法》文件要求，以下成果将按照《市直学校争创“名师名科名校”激励办法》由上级部门进行奖励或岗位补贴。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）获得特级教师、正高级教师、省级教坛新秀、省级及以上优质课一等奖获得者、省“名师名校长培养工程”培养对象、市拔尖人才、绍兴名师、市学科带头人、绍兴市教坛新秀等荣誉称号的；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）获得省级及以上基础教育教学成果或教育科学规划课题成果奖项的；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）凡命名为省级普通高中学科基地的、评为省级精品课程或省级特色学科课程群的、获得市级名学科团队称号的、凡评为绍兴市特色学科课程群的。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%">二、学校教科研成果奖励<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%">1. </SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%">优质课等课堂教学能力比武<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）优质课等课堂教学能力比武教师获奖<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
